Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.26,0:22:01.68,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\c1E1E1E}也可爱无比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:18.15,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对摇摆的蓝色烦扰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:21.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对诱惑魔法的引力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.91,0:22:23.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}明明如此  如此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:25.70,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}努力地抗拒着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.70,0:22:27.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}可无论如何  不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}最终还是会败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:32.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\t(1000,2200,\cC22331)}如果现在能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.63,0:22:36.13,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}愿望如梦般短暂 {\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.13,0:22:38.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}但人生很长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:42.55,EDCN,,0,0,27,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}偶尔迷茫又何妨{\fnA-OTF Shin Maru Go Pr6N DB\fs68}？
